specially important for luxury hotels.=E2=80=9D

Beyond the suite=E2=80=A6

=E2=80=A6 hotels and other hospitality businesses are giving water the high=
-brow treatment in a variety of ways =E2=80=94 several restaurants now have=
 water menus and water sommeliers (https://thehustle.co/news/may-we-interes=
t-you-in-a-water-flight?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-9x6kixPR_v7-G0HZISyaw-GYqSlaynE5d9=
b8pjluiWi5Fqam5MLgGGqxfnE_DEZ1mPegBD1DblCFR-946BWFvt2iE1Rg&_hsmi=3D39129621=
1 ) , and many spas, like the Hotel Royal Evian Spa (https://hotel-royal.ev=
ianresort.com/en/wellness/evian-R-spa?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-9x6kixPR_v7-G0HZISya=
w-GYqSlaynE5d9b8pjluiWi5Fqam5MLgGGqxfnE_DEZ1mPegBD1DblCFR-946BWFvt2iE1Rg&_h=
smi=3D391296211 ) in France, are making H2O a focal point of their services=
.

It=E2=80=99s all part of a broader =E2=80=9Cluxury hydration=E2=80=9D trend=
 that=E2=80=99s given rise to things like $300 medical-grade water bottles =
(https://www.fastcompany.com/91391796/okapa-water-bottle-make-luxury-hydrat=
ion-a-thing?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-9x6kixPR_v7-G0HZISyaw-GYqSlaynE5d9b8pjluiWi5Fq=
am5MLgGGqxfnE_DEZ1mPegBD1DblCFR-946BWFvt2iE1Rg&_hsmi=3D391296211 ) , and wh=
ich leading hydration expert Martin Riese says (https://robbreport.com/trav=
el/hotels/water-luxury-hotel-amenity-1236476132/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-9x6kixPR_=
v7-G0HZISyaw-GYqSlaynE5d9b8pjluiWi5Fqam5MLgGGqxfnE_DEZ1mPegBD1DblCFR-946BWF=
vt2iE1Rg&_hsmi=3D391296211 ) hotels are finally catching on to.

And though the concept =E2=80=94 essentially, the premiumization of life=E2=
=80=99s most basic necessity =E2=80=94 might seem a bit ridiculous, it fits=
 into the greater health and wellness movement influencing today=E2=80=99s =
microplastic-wary, trendy drinkware-loving consumers.

